"WEB_H2_01_desc" => 'Design of the official website for <span>Carlos Ruiz Zafón</span> in collaboration with <span>Editorial Planeta</span>. The site is the definitive portal for fans of the <span>Cemetery of Forgotten Books</span> saga, including <span>The Shadow of the Wind</span> and <span>The Labyrinth of the Spirits</span>. It presents the author\'s complete bibliography in a navigable and engaging way, ideal for purchasing books and discovering his literary universe. We guarantee a digital experience that respects the author\'s legacy, boosting sales of his most iconic novels.',
"WEB_H2_02_desc" => 'Development of the official Spanish website for the bestseller <span>Inferno</span> by <span>Dan Brown</span>, in collaboration with <span>Editorial Planeta</span>. The site is designed to immerse visitors in the world of <span>Robert Langdon</span> in his successful novel, highlighting the connection to Dante and the mystery of the thriller. We guarantee an experience where fans can explore the plot, watch the official trailer, and directly access bookstores in Spain. The website is key to the promotion and success of this suspenseful novel.',
"WEB_H2_03_desc" => 'Design of the official website for <span>The Aleph</span> by <span>Paulo Coelho</span> for <span>Editorial Planeta</span>. The site reflects the spiritual journey and personal transformation proposed by the novel, with an inspiring design. The website facilitates the exploration of Coelho\'s universe for self-help and philosophy readers, including his bibliography and inspirational messages. It is a key element for promoting the book and boosting online sales of this work of profound reflection.',
"WEB_H2_04_desc" => 'Design and creation of the official website for <span>Don\'t Let Them Steal Your Sleep</span> by Dr. <span>Eduard Estivill</span> for <span>Editorial Planeta</span>. The website offers practical solutions for insomnia, sleep hygiene, and sleep disorders. The design is clean and professional, giving users quick access to Dr. Estivill\'s sleep advice and the option to purchase books. The website is fundamental for promoting this essential health and wellness guide, positioning it as the leading resource in the Spanish market.',
"WEB_H2_05_desc" => 'Design of the official website for the <span>Parents University Library</span> by <span>José Antonio Marina</span> for <span>Editroial Planeta</span>. The site is an essential online resource for family education, with an interface that facilitates content access. The website offers access to the bibliography and the digital parenting course, promoting good educational practices and child development. The portal positions Marina as a leading figure and increases subscriptions to courses and educational resources.',
"WEB_H2_07_desc" => 'Creation of the official website for the <span>Educational Innovation Series</span>, a leading event for professionals in the sector and schools. The series is organized in collaboration with <span>Pere Marquès</span> and <span>Clickedu</span>, focusing its presentations on digital transformation and new pedagogical methodologies. The website facilitates professional registration, access to the conference program, and promotion of Clickedu\'s educational solutions. It is the digital meeting point for promoting educational technology in the classroom.',
"WEB_H2_08_desc" => 'Developement of the official website for the launch of the historical novel <span>The Legend of the Thief</span> by <span>Juan Gómez-Jurado</span> for <span>Editorial Planeta</span>. The website reflects the Golden Age setting, mystery, and adventure of the historical thriller. The design focuses on book promotion and sales, offering readers exclusive audiovisual material about the protagonist, Sancho. It is an essential portal for purchasing the novel and immersing oneself in the era of the Inquisition.',
"WEB_H2_09_desc" => 'We created the official website for <span>María Dueñas</span> for <span>Editorial Planeta</span>, an elegant and functional portal. The site is the meeting point for all readers of her acclaimed novels, such as <span>El tiempo entre costuras</span>. The web design highlights the author\'s complete bibliography to date, offers access to exclusive news, and facilitates the purchase of books in both physical and electronic formats. Our work guarantees a high-quality digital presence, reinforcing Dueñas\'s personal brand and her connection with the public.',

